{"id":"torrey:feasts-the-anniversary","source":"torrey","name":"Feasts, The Anniversary","slug":"feasts-the-anniversary","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Instituted by God — Ex 23:14.","refs":[["Exod",23,14,23,14]]},{"text":"Enumerated — Ex 23:15,16.","refs":[["Exod",23,15,23,15],["Exod",23,16,23,16]]},{"text":"Appointed feasts. — Isa 1:14.","refs":[["Isa",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Feasts of the Lord. — Le 23:4.","refs":[["Lev",23,4,23,4]]},{"text":"Solemn feasts. — 2Ch 8:13; La 1:4.","refs":[["2Chr",8,13,8,13],["Lam",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Solemn meetings. — Isa 1:13.","refs":[["Isa",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Were a time of thankfulness — Ps 122:4.","refs":[["Ps",122,4,122,4]]},{"text":"All males to attend — Ex 23:17; 34:23.","refs":[["Exod",23,17,23,17],["Exod",34,23,34,23]]},{"text":"Children commenced attending, when twelve years old — Lu 2:42.","refs":[["Luke",2,42,2,42]]},{"text":"Females often attended — 1Sa 1:3,9; Lu 2:41.","refs":[["1Sam",1,3,1,3],["1Sam",1,9,1,9],["Luke",2,41,2,41]]},{"text":"The Jews attended gladly — Ps 122:1,2.","refs":[["Ps",122,1,122,1],["Ps",122,2,122,2]]},{"text":"The Jews went up to, in large companies — Ps 42:4; Lu 2:44.","refs":[["Ps",42,4,42,4],["Luke",2,44,2,44]]},{"text":"The dangers and difficulties encountered in going up to, alluded to — Ps 84:6,7.","refs":[["Ps",84,6,84,6],["Ps",84,7,84,7]]},{"text":"The land divinely protected during — Ex 34:24.","refs":[["Exod",34,24,34,24]]},{"text":"Offerings to made at — Ex 34:20; De 16:16,17.","refs":[["Exod",34,20,34,20],["Deut",16,16,16,16],["Deut",16,17,16,17]]},{"text":"Joy and gladness. — Ps 42:4; Isa 30:20.","refs":[["Ps",42,4,42,4],["Isa",30,20,30,20]]},{"text":"Sacrificing. — 1Sa 1:3; 1Ki 9:25; 2Ch 8:13.","refs":[["1Sam",1,3,1,3],["1Kgs",9,25,9,25],["2Chr",8,13,8,13]]},{"text":"Entertainments. — 1Sa 1:4,9.","refs":[["1Sam",1,4,1,4],["1Sam",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"The ten tribes seduced by Jeroboam from attending. — 1Ki 12:27.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,27,12,27]]},{"text":"The Jews dispersed in distant parts often attended. — Ac 2:5-11; 8:27.","refs":[["Acts",2,5,2,11],["Acts",8,27,8,27]]},{"text":"Christ attended. — Joh 5:1; 7:10.","refs":[["John",5,1,5,1],["John",7,10,7,10]]},{"text":"Rendered unavailing by the impiety of the Jews. — Isa 1:13,14; Am 5:21.","refs":[["Isa",1,13,1,13],["Isa",1,14,1,14],["Amos",5,21,5,21]]},{"text":"Illustrative of general assembly of the church. — Heb 12:23.","refs":[["Heb",12,23,12,23]]}],"refCount":41}
